        <briefdescription>
<para>getting data from the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref>, <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_face" kindref="compound">Face</ref>, <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_inter_face" kindref="compound">InterFace</ref> </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>GetOperands fills a vector of material property matrices with the required values for later computation. These matrices always have the dimensions spatial-dimension^2 and they will hold either scalar, vector or tensor properties, depending on what kind of property the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_operand" kindref="compound">Operand</ref> is.</para>
<para>When the property is an element property, it will be put into the first vector entry MTRL[0]. </para>
